1
00:01:27,750 --> 00:01:31,399
My god,
brother what have you done?

2
00:01:47,561 --> 00:01:52,357
Yet again we arrived
to witness this monster's aftermath

3
00:01:54,442 --> 00:01:59,031
I will not tolerate this
any longer Markus

4
00:01:59,134 --> 00:02:00,803
Your brother must be stopped!

5
00:02:01,428 --> 00:02:05,077
- It ends tonight
- We must move quickly before they turn

6
00:02:08,727 --> 00:02:13,315
- Is he still here?
- Yes...

7
00:02:13,627 --> 00:02:15,608
Viktor...
He must not be harmed

8
00:02:16,130 --> 00:02:18,424
I gave you my word
did I not?

9
00:02:18,528 --> 00:02:22,594
But William must be controlled

10
00:02:24,158 --> 00:02:28,016
Burn the bodies!
Search the outbuilding!

11
00:02:30,623 --> 00:02:35,315
Markus!
Stay with me

12
00:03:14,832 --> 00:03:16,709
Give me the torch

13
00:03:22,548 --> 00:03:24,633
They're changing!

14
00:05:02,540 --> 00:05:04,103
Retreat to the woods!

15
00:05:04,208 --> 00:05:05,772
I will stay and fight!
You need my help!

16
00:05:05,773 --> 00:05:07,544
I need you alive

17
00:05:07,648 --> 00:05:11,193
If you die, we all die
Now go!

18
00:05:36,947 --> 00:05:38,616
- We found him
- ..and?

19
00:05:38,616 --> 00:05:42,682
- We need more men
- Find Amelia

20
00:05:50,502 --> 00:05:54,360
Amelia, we found William

21
00:06:37,526 --> 00:06:39,090
Leave him be!

22
00:06:43,157 --> 00:06:45,346
Stop this, you're killing him!

23
00:06:47,432 --> 00:06:48,578
More!

24
00:07:13,394 --> 00:07:14,854
William

25
00:07:15,479 --> 00:07:16,939
Markus!

26
00:07:17,669 --> 00:07:20,797
He was not to be harmed!

27
00:07:20,798 --> 00:07:24,759
Place him in my charge as we agreed
or you will pay for your deceit

28
00:07:24,968 --> 00:07:27,887
And you will learn your place

29
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:30,181
Your sympathy for this beast
is foolish

30
00:07:30,183 --> 00:07:33,934
Your brother is entirely
beyond control

31
00:07:34,039 --> 00:07:35,812
It will be done my way

32
00:07:35,821 --> 00:07:39,012
You know well the consequences
if you murder me or William

33
00:07:39,044 --> 00:07:46,238
If you so much as speak his name again you
will have chosen that future for him

34
00:07:54,579 --> 00:07:55,935
What is thy will...

35
00:07:57,082 --> 00:07:58,124
... my lord

36
00:07:59,688 --> 00:08:04,693
Imprisonment for all time

37
00:08:04,902 --> 00:08:06,778
Far from you

38
00:08:16,267 --> 00:08:20,542
For 6 centuries I was a loyal
soldier of the Vampire clan

39
00:08:22,836 --> 00:08:24,400
But I was betrayed

40
00:08:25,964 --> 00:08:28,674
The war was not as it had seemed

41
00:08:29,509 --> 00:08:34,929
In one night the lies that have
united our kind has been exposed

42
00:08:34,930 --> 00:08:41,291
Craven our second in command had
formed a secret alliance with Lucian...

43
00:08:41,293 --> 00:08:43,897
...ruler of the Werewolf clan...

44
00:08:44,210 --> 00:08:46,087
... to overthrow Viktor, our leader

45
00:08:47,338 --> 00:08:51,092
But Craven's lust for power and
domination had failed

46
00:08:51,822 --> 00:08:54,741
Viktor is not the savior
I had lead to believe

47
00:08:58,390 --> 00:09:00,580
He had betrayed us all

48
00:09:06,315 --> 00:09:08,921
Soon the hunt will be on
for his killer

49
00:09:12,988 --> 00:09:17,054
I have but one ally left,
Michael

50
00:09:17,888 --> 00:09:20,703
The human descendent of Corvinus

51
00:09:21,225 --> 00:09:25,187
Not a Vampire nor Lycan
but a hybrid

52
00:09:28,523 --> 00:09:32,173
It's only a matter of time
before we're found

53
00:09:53,547 --> 00:09:56,050
My only hope now is to
awaken Markus...

54
00:09:56,675 --> 00:10:01,367
... our last remaining elder
and expose the truth

55
00:10:01,367 --> 00:10:04,704
before Craven tries to murder
him while still in hibernation

56
00:10:08,047 --> 00:10:10,334
Craven knows he is no match
for him awake

57
00:11:23,738 --> 00:11:25,823
This thing has been dead
for weeks

58
00:11:25,928 --> 00:11:28,534
I thought lycans went back to
their human form when they died

59
00:11:28,535 --> 00:11:34,050
They do, this one's been given a
serum to stop regression so it can
be studied

60
00:11:34,165 --> 00:11:35,520
How can you tell?

61
00:11:42,298 --> 00:11:45,634
- Not quite your department I guess
- I just kill them...

62
00:11:45,636 --> 00:11:48,554
... don't pay much attention
to their anatomy

63
00:11:48,658 --> 00:11:51,265
- How long can we stay here?
- Not long

64
00:11:51,369 --> 00:11:54,601
These safe houses are all linked
together on one mainframe...

65
00:11:54,603 --> 00:11:56,791
... motion sensors say which
ones are active

66
00:11:56,791 --> 00:11:59,189
Someone could have picked us
up already

67
00:12:07,217 --> 00:12:09,824
It's only about an hour to daylight

68
00:12:09,825 --> 00:12:12,326
Can you even make it back to
the mansion before sunrise?

69
00:12:12,431 --> 00:12:13,369
Just

70
00:12:13,473 --> 00:12:15,454
Ok, let's get what we need and go

71
00:12:15,559 --> 00:12:16,601
No

72
00:12:17,435 --> 00:12:20,251
I'm going alone

73
00:12:39,540 --> 00:12:40,687
Open it

74
00:14:26,935 --> 00:14:33,191
- Markus...
- The blood memories of this wretched creature...

75
00:14:33,816 --> 00:14:37,987
... has shown me that your
treachery knows no bounds

76
00:14:40,176 --> 00:14:42,679
My lord, I can explain

77
00:14:43,304 --> 00:14:49,039
Why should I listen to your lies?
When the journey to the truth...

78
00:14:53,418 --> 00:14:56,129
... is so much sweeter

79
00:15:03,845 --> 00:15:06,347
I kept the secrets

80
00:15:06,452 --> 00:15:10,518
Cleaned up the mess
"You will go before Viktor..."

81
00:15:11,144 --> 00:15:12,395
"... and tell him exactly what
I tell you to"

82
00:15:25,845 --> 00:15:28,556
Please ... I can assist you

83
00:15:30,329 --> 00:15:31,893
Oh you already have

84
00:15:40,026 --> 00:15:43,154
If I complete my case there's a
chance you'll be granted sanctuary

85
00:15:43,155 --> 00:15:45,656
Right now you'll be killed on sight

86
00:15:45,761 --> 00:15:48,054
- Not willing to risk it
- What am I supposed to do sit here and wait?

87
00:15:48,054 --> 00:15:50,556
Craven may still have his men with him,
you're not going alone

88
00:15:50,558 --> 00:15:53,997
- You're not as strong as you might think
- What?

89
00:15:53,999 --> 00:15:55,248
Michael, you're unique

90
00:15:55,666 --> 00:15:58,378
There has never been a hybrid before

91
00:15:58,378 --> 00:16:01,817
However ambivalent you are about it,
The truth is your powers may be limitless

92
00:16:01,818 --> 00:16:04,945
You depend on blood, you need
to feed

93
00:16:05,572 --> 00:16:09,012
Without it you will be growing
weaker by the second, use the time for that

94
00:16:09,950 --> 00:16:15,998
Jesus Christ... and what if I don't?
Or if I can't?

95
00:16:15,999 --> 00:16:17,040
It could be lethal

96
00:16:17,041 --> 00:16:20,481
If you don't anticipate your cravings,
you will attack humans

97
00:16:20,482 --> 00:16:25,069
And believe me you don't want
that on your conscience

98
00:16:25,070 --> 00:16:27,988
There really is no going back Michael

99
00:16:29,239 --> 00:16:30,699
I'm Sorry

100
00:16:31,638 --> 00:16:35,495
Look I understand what you did,
I'm grateful

101
00:16:36,642 --> 00:16:39,353
You saved my life

102
00:16:40,292 --> 00:16:42,377
I wasn't ready to die

103
00:16:47,590 --> 00:16:50,093
Everything has changed...

104
00:16:50,094 --> 00:16:56,244
... I probably needed a minute to think
the process all at once

105
00:16:56,246 --> 00:17:00,311
Look, go, I'll be here

106
00:17:00,416 --> 00:17:03,439
Just make sure you come back

107
00:18:26,956 --> 00:18:27,895
Sir

108
00:18:28,416 --> 00:18:32,378
Witness has been silenced?

109
00:18:32,900 --> 00:18:36,132
But otherwise unharmed as ordered

110
00:18:39,260 --> 00:18:41,762
- Show me what you have
- Yes sir

111
00:18:47,497 --> 00:18:51,251
2 Death Dealers we killed,
we found no lycan bodies

112
00:18:51,252 --> 00:18:56,777
Apparently they we using some kind of
new ammunition, some sort of UV round

113
00:18:57,089 --> 00:18:58,653
Amelia?

114
00:19:00,843 --> 00:19:02,720
No one survived

115
00:19:02,824 --> 00:19:07,829
It seems Craven's men may have been present
but did nothing to prevent it

116
00:19:07,933 --> 00:19:09,706
and Viktor?

117
00:19:30,038 --> 00:19:37,024
- No trace of Markus amongst the ashes?
- It seems he has destroyed his own coven

118
00:19:37,336 --> 00:19:40,256
It was never his coven

119
00:20:04,446 --> 00:20:05,384
"We need to go"

120
00:20:49,176 --> 00:20:50,636
Give me a moment

121
00:24:14,060 --> 00:24:15,207
How ya' doing

122
00:24:36,894 --> 00:24:37,614
Thank you

123
00:25:46,440 --> 00:25:48,213
"... Michael Corvin ..."

124
00:28:44,945 --> 00:28:45,466
Michael

125
00:28:54,746 --> 00:28:57,457
- Here, take it
- No

126
00:28:57,665 --> 00:28:59,125
Michael you'll die

127
00:29:27,277 --> 00:29:28,633
Can you move?

128
00:29:33,637 --> 00:29:34,680
We need to go

129
00:29:55,846 --> 00:29:59,287
- Markus
- I know what you've done, Selene

130
00:30:00,121 --> 00:30:03,041
Viktor deserved his fate
Craven was no better

131
00:30:03,043 --> 00:30:08,358
Craven has already reaped the rewards
of his own misdeeds

132
00:30:08,671 --> 00:30:12,529
and Viktor, he deserved his fate...

133
00:30:12,842 --> 00:30:15,344
... many times over

134
00:30:16,491 --> 00:30:20,245
A terrible business the slaying
of your family

135
00:30:21,287 --> 00:30:26,501
Yet so much effort was spent to
conceal this from me

136
00:30:27,856 --> 00:30:30,567
What do you suppose Viktor
had to hide?

137
00:30:31,714 --> 00:30:35,050
Or perhaps, it is you Selene

138
00:30:37,344 --> 00:30:43,705
As the last of your wretched family
who has something to hide

139
00:30:53,714 --> 00:30:54,340
Go!

140
00:32:39,337 --> 00:32:44,133
Dead or alive, you will give
me what I want

141
00:33:56,806 --> 00:33:58,579
You okay?

142
00:34:02,020 --> 00:34:04,835
- He's a hybrid isn't he?
- Yes

143
00:34:05,460 --> 00:34:07,859
He wanted this
Why?

144
00:34:08,797 --> 00:34:11,092
I don't know

145
00:34:11,099 --> 00:34:15,157
But we have another problem

146
00:34:18,807 --> 00:34:21,830
Turn off up here

147
00:34:26,105 --> 00:34:27,044
Get down

148
00:34:28,191 --> 00:34:31,110
Keep your foot on the gas
and stay down!

149
00:34:45,812 --> 00:34:46,542
Hold on!

150
00:36:17,775 --> 00:36:19,339
Give me your hand

151
00:36:20,486 --> 00:36:22,675
Jesus Christ

152
00:36:23,405 --> 00:36:25,803
- There's really no need
- Be right back

153
00:36:43,112 --> 00:36:44,988
Let me see

154
00:36:49,159 --> 00:36:50,098
See...

155
00:36:50,202 --> 00:36:52,702
...no need

156
00:40:41,152 --> 00:40:42,508
Area secure sir

157
00:42:09,779 --> 00:42:12,594
The sun is setting

158
00:42:13,116 --> 00:42:15,409
What's wrong?

159
00:42:21,457 --> 00:42:24,689
If supplies were taken used
weapons were left behind

160
00:42:24,690 --> 00:42:27,921
they couldn't have gone very far

161
00:42:27,922 --> 00:42:31,884
Remain airborne for the moment
I'm sure they will re-appear

162
00:42:31,885 --> 00:42:32,509
Yes sir

163
00:42:37,410 --> 00:42:40,225
I've seen this before when
I was a child

164
00:42:40,955 --> 00:42:44,291
I've held it when it was
open like this

165
00:42:44,292 --> 00:42:45,751
How is that possible?

166
00:42:47,107 --> 00:42:48,462
I don't know

167
00:42:51,590 --> 00:42:54,197
But I know someone that might

168
00:42:54,197 --> 00:42:58,472
Andreas Tanis, he was the official
historian of the covens

169
00:43:01,808 --> 00:43:05,770
He fell from favor after documenting
what Viktor considered malicious lies

170
00:43:05,771 --> 00:43:08,377
Of course as it turns out he's
been telling the truth

171
00:43:08,481 --> 00:43:12,756
- What happened to him?
- He was exiled over 300 years ago

172
00:43:12,757 --> 00:43:16,718
300 years?  What makes you think
we're going to find him now?

173
00:43:16,719 --> 00:43:19,221
I was the one who exiled him

174
00:43:57,486 --> 00:44:01,761
- Looks like a monastery
- It used to be, more like a prison now

175
00:44:02,180 --> 00:44:04,681
Tanis has been hiding there since
Viktor's order

176
00:44:04,682 --> 00:44:07,809
We're the most people he'd
seen in centuries

177
00:44:19,174 --> 00:44:21,259
- That's odd
- What?

178
00:44:21,676 --> 00:44:24,909
I don't remember this
gate being here before

179
00:44:26,577 --> 00:44:28,349
Take this

180
00:45:58,540 --> 00:45:59,166
Go back!

181
00:46:02,085 --> 00:46:02,711
Got you

182
00:46:06,256 --> 00:46:06,881
Fuck

183
00:48:41,509 --> 00:48:43,281
I knew it was you Selene

184
00:48:43,594 --> 00:48:47,765
The stench of Viktor's blood
still lingers in your veins

185
00:48:47,766 --> 00:48:51,310
Tanis, I see your aim hasn't improved

186
00:48:53,291 --> 00:48:57,357
You haven't changed
You don't scare me Selene

187
00:48:58,400 --> 00:49:01,424
Well we're going to have
to work on that

188
00:49:10,495 --> 00:49:11,538
We need to talk

189
00:49:16,230 --> 00:49:19,358
Your exile seems a bit more
comfortable than I remember

190
00:49:19,462 --> 00:49:23,111
- How does a Vampire have Lycan bodyguards?
- A gift

191
00:49:23,320 --> 00:49:26,343
From a most persuasive client

192
00:49:26,448 --> 00:49:27,595
Lucian

193
00:49:29,159 --> 00:49:31,244
Why would Lucian want to protect you?

194
00:49:31,974 --> 00:49:34,581
Because he was trading with them

195
00:49:36,145 --> 00:49:41,462
UV rounds, how long have you been in
the business of killing your own kind

196
00:49:41,464 --> 00:49:43,235
I've done what's necessary to survive

197
00:49:44,069 --> 00:49:48,239
My decision was easy once your
precious Viktor betrayed me

198
00:49:48,657 --> 00:49:51,263
Betrayal was something he did
very well

199
00:49:53,036 --> 00:49:55,330
Viktor's dead
I killed him

200
00:49:55,955 --> 00:49:58,353
You?  Killed Viktor?

201
00:50:03,150 --> 00:50:04,922
No I think not

202
00:50:07,529 --> 00:50:10,553
Oh unless you've learned the truth

203
00:50:14,723 --> 00:50:17,226
So your eyes are finally open

204
00:50:18,373 --> 00:50:23,169
Ain't it interesting that the truth
is even harder to absorb than lies

205
00:50:23,170 --> 00:50:29,842
You know I tried to stop him of course,
a travesty committing such a horrible crime

206
00:50:29,843 --> 00:50:33,387
And then turning you
That was too much to take

207
00:50:33,700 --> 00:50:37,662
My protest as to why he put me here

208
00:50:37,663 --> 00:50:41,728
Careful with that dear...
... makes a terrible bang

209
00:50:42,250 --> 00:50:44,961
Open the blades and they're active

210
00:50:45,273 --> 00:50:46,525
Good to know

211
00:50:50,695 --> 00:50:55,909
Viktor put you here for a reason but
I doubt its because you had moral qualms

212
00:50:55,910 --> 00:50:58,619
- What do you know?
- Very little of anything...

213
00:50:58,621 --> 00:50:59,662
... I'm afraid

214
00:51:06,127 --> 00:51:10,923
Oh, then perhaps I may be mistaken,
then there's no use for you at all

215
00:51:10,924 --> 00:51:13,321
Markus was after this
Why?

216
00:51:57,634 --> 00:51:59,928
Some history is based on truth...

217
00:52:00,762 --> 00:52:02,014
... and others on deception

218
00:52:04,412 --> 00:52:08,061
Viktor was not the first of our
kind as you were led to believe

219
00:52:08,062 --> 00:52:12,232
He was once human,
ruler of his lands

220
00:52:14,109 --> 00:52:18,801
Markus,
he's the one

221
00:52:20,156 --> 00:52:24,639
The source,
the first true Vampire

222
00:52:25,369 --> 00:52:27,767
So the legend is true

223
00:52:28,497 --> 00:52:30,895
Toward the end of his ruthless life

224
00:52:32,564 --> 00:52:37,047
his next breath meant more to
Viktor than silver or gold

225
00:52:37,048 --> 00:52:41,843
Markus came with an offer,
a reprieve ...

226
00:52:42,573 --> 00:52:45,701
... from sickness and death
Immortality

227
00:52:46,640 --> 00:52:51,227
In return, Viktor was to use his
army turned immortal to protect him

228
00:52:51,228 --> 00:52:52,374
To do what?

229
00:52:52,896 --> 00:52:55,190
To defeat the very first werewolves

230
00:52:55,607 --> 00:53:01,029
A dangerous and very infectious breed
Created by Markus's own flesh and blood

231
00:53:03,114 --> 00:53:04,991
His twin brother William

232
00:53:06,867 --> 00:53:11,455
But these weren't the Lycans we know
disgusting as your brethren may be ...

233
00:53:11,456 --> 00:53:15,939
... they at least are evolved
No these were raging monsters

234
00:53:15,948 --> 00:53:19,171
Never able to take human form again

235
00:53:19,180 --> 00:53:22,090
It's only the later generations that
learned to channel their rage

236
00:53:22,300 --> 00:53:26,470
And William's appetite for destruction
and rampage was insatiable

237
00:53:27,721 --> 00:53:32,308
He had to be stopped,
So once Viktor's army was turned ...

238
00:53:32,310 --> 00:53:37,000
... the legions of Vampires under his control
tracked down and destroyed the animals

239
00:53:37,835 --> 00:53:41,484
Then captured William and locked him away

240
00:53:41,692 --> 00:53:44,299
Viktor's prisoner for all time

241
00:53:46,697 --> 00:53:47,948
Why let him live?

242
00:53:47,950 --> 00:53:51,076
For the same reason why Viktor
never conspired against Markus

243
00:53:51,078 --> 00:53:52,328
Fear

244
00:53:52,849 --> 00:53:59,731
He was warned if Markus should ever be killed,
all those in his blood line would follow him to the grave

245
00:53:59,835 --> 00:54:04,527
So in Viktor's mind, William's death would
be the end for all Lycans ...

246
00:54:04,528 --> 00:54:05,882
... his slaves

247
00:54:07,446 --> 00:54:08,802
Yes

248
00:54:10,157 --> 00:54:15,370
Yes a clever deception
but one Viktor was hardly willing to put to the test

249
00:54:16,830 --> 00:54:20,480
So Markus was protected,
at all costs

250
00:54:24,755 --> 00:54:28,300
Ah yes, here we are

251
00:54:31,428 --> 00:54:34,034
- Vampires?
- Mortals

252
00:54:34,973 --> 00:54:37,371
Men loyal to Alexander Corvinus

253
00:54:39,978 --> 00:54:42,063
The father of us all

254
00:54:49,153 --> 00:54:50,196
What's this?

255
00:54:54,471 --> 00:54:58,641
You should know,
It's William's prison

256
00:55:01,144 --> 00:55:05,002
The prison your father was
commissioned to build

257
00:55:10,215 --> 00:55:13,656
"So you've been the one keeping
a watch over this for me have you"

258
00:55:21,163 --> 00:55:22,206
What is it?

259
00:55:23,144 --> 00:55:24,499
what's wrong?

260
00:55:25,438 --> 00:55:29,400
She now understands why her
family was killed

261
00:55:31,590 --> 00:55:33,883
But that was many years later

262
00:55:35,030 --> 00:55:38,992
The winter of Lucian's escape,
your father knew too much

263
00:55:39,305 --> 00:55:41,599
or too much for Viktor to risk

264
00:55:41,600 --> 00:55:47,021
Especially when Lucian had the
key to William's cell

265
00:55:48,689 --> 00:55:51,609
And I'm the map

266
00:55:51,817 --> 00:55:53,694
Yes

267
00:55:54,007 --> 00:55:58,490
The only one still living who
has seen its location

268
00:55:59,220 --> 00:56:02,870
Oh Viktor realized you'd be too
young to remember explicitly ...

269
00:56:02,873 --> 00:56:09,647
... but Markus knows that the memory and
therefore the exact location of Williams prison ...

270
00:56:09,855 --> 00:56:11,941
... is hidden away in your blood

271
00:56:13,192 --> 00:56:17,154
Why is Markus looking for him now?
After all this time?

272
00:56:17,675 --> 00:56:19,656
That I cannot answer

273
00:56:30,500 --> 00:56:35,922
But I do know someone who could stop him,
perhaps I could arrange a meeting

274
00:56:36,131 --> 00:56:40,614
In exchange for your discretion
of course

275
00:56:41,970 --> 00:56:42,908
Of course

276
00:57:38,378 --> 00:57:41,193
Tanis, you seem anxious

277
00:57:42,027 --> 00:57:44,738
Why do you flee the very sight of me?

278
00:57:49,951 --> 00:57:52,767
Please, sit

279
00:57:54,956 --> 00:57:58,918
There's no need for this to
be unpleasant

280
00:57:58,918 --> 00:58:01,838
I always rather enjoyed
your company

281
00:58:07,468 --> 00:58:08,928
Now you're being rude

282
00:58:10,805 --> 00:58:12,473
Sorry

283
00:58:20,501 --> 00:58:25,089
Viktor struck 2 keys,
what do you know of them?

284
00:58:26,549 --> 00:58:32,179
Keys?
I don't know of any keys

285
00:58:47,496 --> 00:58:50,947
Oh yes, those keys

286
00:58:53,763 --> 00:58:58,872
Yes?
One was kept in plain sight...

287
00:58:58,976 --> 00:59:02,000
... draped around his daughters neck

288
00:59:02,104 --> 00:59:05,128
- Right there for you to see
- And the other?

289
00:59:07,213 --> 00:59:10,132
- Kept with Viktor at all times
- Where?

290
00:59:11,279 --> 00:59:12,113
Within him

291
00:59:14,512 --> 00:59:16,493
Beneath the flesh

292
00:59:44,540 --> 00:59:46,730
... perhaps I could arrange a meeting

293
00:59:46,731 --> 00:59:49,962
... go to pier 17, ask for Lorenz Macaro

294
01:00:14,048 --> 01:00:21,138
- How do you know he's not just setting us up?
- He's not brave enough to set me up

295
01:00:45,119 --> 01:00:45,953
You can go

296
01:00:56,484 --> 01:00:58,257
You're familiar with this then?

297
01:01:06,181 --> 01:01:07,328
Intimately

298
01:01:14,627 --> 01:01:16,504
You are Alexander Corvinus

299
01:01:21,925 --> 01:01:26,305
There was a time when I
was known by that name

300
01:01:27,764 --> 01:01:31,622
By any name I am still
your forefather

301
01:01:37,148 --> 01:01:40,381
How have you stayed hidden
all these years?

302
01:01:40,589 --> 01:01:46,220
For centuries I have stood by and watched
the havoc my sons have brought upon each other ...

303
01:01:46,221 --> 01:01:47,784
... and upon humanity

304
01:01:49,556 --> 01:01:55,082
Not the legacy I prayed for the morning
I watched them enter this world

305
01:01:55,083 --> 01:02:00,191
And a tiresome duty!
Keeping the war contained, cleaning up the mess

306
01:02:01,443 --> 01:02:04,988
Hiding my family's unfortunate history

307
01:02:05,300 --> 01:02:08,220
- Couldn't you have stopped it?
- Yes ...

308
01:02:08,533 --> 01:02:13,642
- Could you kill your own sons?
- You know what Markus will do?

309
01:02:13,643 --> 01:02:16,561
If he finds me, he finds William's prison

310
01:02:16,770 --> 01:02:20,315
You need to help us stop him

311
01:02:20,316 --> 01:02:24,277
You are asking me to help you
kill my son?

312
01:02:24,278 --> 01:02:28,031
You?  A Death Dealer?

313
01:02:28,448 --> 01:02:32,410
How many innocents did killed in the
6 century quest to avenge your family?

314
01:02:32,411 --> 01:02:37,206
Spare me your self-righteous declarations,
you are no different from Markus

315
01:02:37,207 --> 01:02:39,708
And even less noble than William

316
01:02:40,230 --> 01:02:43,358
At least he cannot control
his savagery

317
01:02:43,359 --> 01:02:46,590
Anything I've done can be
laid at your feet

318
01:02:46,591 --> 01:02:49,822
Hundreds of thousands have died
because of your inability to accept ...

319
01:02:49,823 --> 01:02:51,803
... that you sons are monsters!

320
01:02:51,908 --> 01:02:54,306
That they create monsters!

321
01:02:54,307 --> 01:02:55,609
You could have stopped all of this

322
01:02:55,610 --> 01:03:01,396
Don't come groveling to me simply
because you are weaker than your adversary

323
01:03:01,397 --> 01:03:04,211
You know the devastation William
caused before he was captured

324
01:03:04,212 --> 01:03:06,296
He cannot be set free

325
01:03:53,633 --> 01:03:55,510
No, wait!

326
01:03:55,719 --> 01:03:58,325
You're no match for him

327
01:04:20,117 --> 01:04:22,098
Soon, brother

328
01:05:13,710 --> 01:05:17,360
They're gone...
... there, there, my child, you are safe now

329
01:06:06,573 --> 01:06:08,659
No, Michael

330
01:06:09,806 --> 01:06:11,578
Look at me!

331
01:06:12,934 --> 01:06:14,393
Michael!

332
01:07:52,508 --> 01:07:54,177
Hello father

333
01:07:55,115 --> 01:07:57,722
You are unwelcomed in my presence

334
01:07:58,973 --> 01:08:03,769
Ah, the predictable heart,
that never thaws

335
01:08:05,020 --> 01:08:08,253
Pity it beats within such a fool

336
01:08:09,087 --> 01:08:11,172
The eldest of the immortals...

337
01:08:11,589 --> 01:08:15,864
... yet you have made no attempt
to seize your destiny

338
01:08:15,865 --> 01:08:19,513
We are oddities of nature
you and I

339
01:08:19,619 --> 01:08:21,077
Nothing more

340
01:08:21,182 --> 01:08:23,788
This is a world for humanity

341
01:08:23,789 --> 01:08:28,480
And that petty sentiment explains
why you rejected your sons?

342
01:08:28,481 --> 01:08:34,319
Why you stood by for half a millennium
as William suffered alone in darkness?

343
01:08:34,945 --> 01:08:40,471
No father, I have no sympathy
for your petty sentiment

344
01:08:42,765 --> 01:08:45,789
Viktor's key ... where is it?

345
01:08:46,101 --> 01:08:50,272
Whatever plan you have for William
is futile, you cannot control him

346
01:08:50,273 --> 01:08:52,670
Oh I am stronger now

347
01:08:53,088 --> 01:08:55,798
And our bond is greater than
you've ever wanted to acknowledge

348
01:08:55,799 --> 01:09:00,542
You're wrong, soon you'll be drowning
in Lycans just like before

349
01:09:00,564 --> 01:09:04,244
Not Lycans father or vampires

350
01:09:04,765 --> 01:09:08,936
A new race, created in the image
of their maker

351
01:09:10,500 --> 01:09:11,438
Their new god

352
01:09:14,983 --> 01:09:16,130
Me

353
01:09:28,955 --> 01:09:31,249
And a true god ...

354
01:09:36,045 --> 01:09:38,235
... has no father

355
01:10:13,894 --> 01:10:15,979
You will fail

356
01:10:51,430 --> 01:10:53,307
- Get the kit!
- No!

357
01:11:00,397 --> 01:11:03,212
Please sir, let us help you

358
01:11:04,463 --> 01:11:07,278
The time has come my friend

359
01:11:08,008 --> 01:11:09,885
Find the girl ...

360
01:11:10,823 --> 01:11:12,387
... bring her to me

361
01:11:18,539 --> 01:11:19,790
No, wait, wait

362
01:11:23,648 --> 01:11:28,340
If you want Markus, you will
need Alexander's help

363
01:11:33,032 --> 01:11:34,701
Don't leave him here

364
01:11:55,033 --> 01:11:57,222
- Did he get the pendant?
- Yes

365
01:11:59,620 --> 01:12:01,914
He's too powerful for you alone

366
01:12:02,644 --> 01:12:07,023
You're the only one older than
he is, the only one stronger

367
01:12:07,232 --> 01:12:09,004
You could have killed him yourself

368
01:12:10,881 --> 01:12:14,113
No matter what he's become ...

369
01:12:15,052 --> 01:12:18,284
... he is my son

370
01:12:22,976 --> 01:12:24,540
You are the last hope left

371
01:12:26,625 --> 01:12:29,441
There is only one way to
defeat him

372
01:12:37,261 --> 01:12:43,517
Quickly now, before there is no
more legacy left in my veins

373
01:12:52,066 --> 01:12:53,735
What will I become?

374
01:12:55,924 --> 01:12:58,739
The future

375
01:13:40,550 --> 01:13:42,114
Go now

376
01:17:30,041 --> 01:17:31,084
We're getting close

377
01:18:26,658 --> 01:18:28,535
Head back around towards the river

378
01:18:40,734 --> 01:18:42,924
I don't see a way inside

379
01:18:45,322 --> 01:18:48,137
There used to be a river
entrance just there

380
01:18:48,345 --> 01:18:50,222
It must be submerged now

381
01:18:50,223 --> 01:18:52,725
Looks like we're getting wet

382
01:19:27,654 --> 01:19:28,280
Closer!

383
01:19:34,848 --> 01:19:36,412
Selene!

384
01:20:49,608 --> 01:20:50,640
William ...

385
01:21:06,395 --> 01:21:06,812
Wait

386
01:21:12,963 --> 01:21:14,840
No William stop!

387
01:21:14,944 --> 01:21:16,508
Be still brother

388
01:21:17,030 --> 01:21:18,281
It's me

389
01:21:21,826 --> 01:21:24,745
I'd no sooner harm you than myself

390
01:21:57,277 --> 01:21:58,111
Which way?

391
01:22:26,159 --> 01:22:27,097
Is this it?

392
01:22:32,310 --> 01:22:33,770
He's already here

393
01:23:08,074 --> 01:23:11,097
- What is it?
- Nothing

394
01:23:11,827 --> 01:23:13,183
Let's go

395
01:23:24,444 --> 01:23:26,112
We're too late

396
01:24:05,212 --> 01:24:06,046
Impressive

397
01:25:15,905 --> 01:25:17,469
Michael you're unique

398
01:25:19,658 --> 01:25:22,578
There's never been a hybrid before

399
01:25:23,151 --> 01:25:25,706
You powers could be limitless

400
01:25:42,493 --> 01:25:43,431
Hold it!

401
01:25:48,749 --> 01:25:51,877
- Where is he?
- He went right through there

402
01:25:53,232 --> 01:25:56,047
All we have is UV rounds,
it won't take him down

403
01:25:56,049 --> 01:25:58,216
No, but it'll slow him down

404
01:26:44,740 --> 01:26:46,095
Let's go

405
01:26:46,512 --> 01:26:47,242
You alright?

406
01:30:00,031 --> 01:30:05,245
No these are not the lycans you know ...
... raging monsters ... unable to take human form ever again

407
01:30:54,771 --> 01:30:55,814
What are you waiting for?

408
01:30:55,815 --> 01:30:57,274
Shoot 'em!

409
01:30:57,275 --> 01:30:59,359
I can't, not without taking
her out!

410
01:30:59,464 --> 01:31:01,444
I can't get a shot!

411
01:31:52,431 --> 01:31:54,099
Michael

412
01:32:30,175 --> 01:32:30,801
Take him down!

413
01:34:50,414 --> 01:34:51,039
William!

414
01:35:02,509 --> 01:35:07,201
I knew Viktor made a mistake
by keeping you as a pet

415
01:35:07,202 --> 01:35:11,267
He should have killed you
with the rest of you family

416
01:37:58,719 --> 01:38:01,013
An unknown chapter lies ahead

417
01:38:01,952 --> 01:38:05,705
The lines that have divided the
clans has now been blurred

418
01:38:05,706 --> 01:38:08,833
Chaos and infighting are inevitable

419
01:38:08,834 --> 01:38:12,691
All that is certain is that
darkness is still ahead

420
01:38:12,692 --> 01:38:15,923
But for now for the first time

421
01:38:16,550 --> 01:38:20,094
I look into the light with new hope
